{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:73ddf0bcf40f4e1f74e3d7c3aa12b556dc0ca2863ff2b79758976681daf05880",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_b:2_4_015_02_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:078a63a2dc76b68a268d6445ec2849e0e7f80149b39616dffbcc2e163eb27ba1",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦啦！\n练习结束了，我等下就顺路去一趟事务所。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_b:2_4_015_02_09_b:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82d16ff1f7892a6fe5db192c45cc0b915a246d5cfa2aae5e824095bb98c181d9",
      "text": "虽然是为工作而练习，但像这样大家一起\n运动，果然还是超级开心的啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_b:2_4_015_02_09_b:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7458cfcd0d7991547324b40adbda2e2f3e9604c5d2a291f20d9fa297efd3e265",
      "text": "对了对了，回去路上我和秋月他们一起顺路去了趟\n便利店，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_b:2_4_015_02_09_b:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbc5488410b7a3ea1de46d37bba8c05256ca8966c073ecb05c8602fc4aefa60c",
      "text": "那时候大家说试着化身成自己演的角色\n即兴对对话看看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_b:2_4_015_02_09_b:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d863b158290284ea6461981182dac6de8e1fc1d8119ec8a41b40cefc8450590e",
      "text": "我也试了试……果然，\n说话生硬的角色好难演啊～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_b:2_4_015_02_09_b:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:106560289625b3ccf43f1a6a65ae63b43ffaab7579a6d57300411ca5e9f18ab9",
      "text": "躲避球的练习固然重要，但我再次深切体会到\n角色塑造也得好好努力才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_b:2_4_015_02_09_b:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bdbf6a84f7ef289e79242f2e162c9e17860eefb8db4c5e3973bad6e81e13e3e",
      "text": "龙先生的话\n一定没问题的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_b:2_4_015_02_09_b:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ce0df9e3e0f760ec880033e99ababc7430b4886ab355f5c59827a357b612661",
      "text": "随时都可以\n找我商量哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_b:2_4_015_02_09_b:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45ae3456b58cbf3aa8e5439e642eb3ee3ee9069cc675febd16a8848dabda9eee",
      "text": "谢谢……！能得到制作人\n这么说，我就踏实多了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_b:2_4_015_02_09_b:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76108f7eede20c65bbc11813a3f4daae2a3a64771cb51f878099a05622a96632",
      "text": "那快到事务所的时候我再联系你！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
